---
// Profile component: name, title, location, about
---

<section id="profile" class="flex min-h-[680px] scroll-mt-28 items-center">
  <div class="max-w-4xl">
    <div class="chip mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-3 py-1 font-geist text-sm text-[#c4c7c8]">
      <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
      Based in South Africa, WC
    </div>
    <h1 class="max-w-3xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white md:text-7xl">
      Brandon Jason de Bruyn
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl border-l-2 border-white/10 pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[#c4c7c8]">
      Full-Stack Engineer | ASP.NET Core, Angular, React, PostgreSQL | Building SaaS & Desktop Applications
    </p>
    <div class="mt-7 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-base leading-7 text-[#c4c7c8]">
      <p>
        I'm a full-stack software engineer focused on building scalable web and desktop applications using
        ASP.NET Core, Angular, React, PostgreSQL, and SQL Server.
      </p>
      <p>
        My experience includes developing business-critical software, building cross-platform desktop
        applications, and contributing across the full development lifecycle from architecture and backend APIs
        to frontend experiences and deployment workflows.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm particularly interested in modern SaaS platforms, desktop applications, cloud-native systems, and
        remote-first engineering environments where ownership and product thinking are valued.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
      <a href="#projects" class="btn-primary">View Projects</a>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-secondary">Contact Me</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
